## Frontend (Vite) environment variables
#
# In development, the app calls the API via `/api` (Vite dev-server proxy).
# Set `VITE_API_TARGET` to wherever your Fastify API is listening.
#
# Example:
# - API on port 3000: VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
# - API on port 3001: VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:3001

VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
